<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11614] Transaction with timeout on cache hangs after cache store failure</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11614</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If CacheStore fails before/during transaction commit, transaction with set timeout remains active.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Setting cfg.setTransactionConfiguration(new TransactionConfiguration().setTxTimeoutOnPartitionMapExchange(5000)); fixes the issue in test.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13223404">IGNITE-11614</key>
            <summary>Transaction with timeout on cache hangs after cache store failure</summary>
